{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_011_title", "source_sha256": "e4363747f1646dc941d4c19a811e15bdfdf1d24fcda844feb91d1d8b39c44309", "ja": "ウエストサイドスター！", "zh": "西城明星！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_011_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4febc688b947685a92caf417425b3a1d6f8670aa8de53b5b8a712a2a824842c4", "ja": "次の公演のセンターに選ばれた奈緒。\nアイドルらしいトークのために、と特訓した\n『東京弁』を披露するが上手くいかない。\nしかし、大事なのはいつもの自分だと気づき\n関西弁のままで見事に公演を成功させる。", "zh": "奈绪被选为下次公演的Center。\n她为了让讲话更有偶像的感觉，而特别练习\n『东京腔』，却无法在大家面前流畅地表达。\n然而，她察觉最重要的是展现平常的自己后，\n用原本的关西腔顺利完成了公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_011_1000_p", "source_sha256": "34c987e583781a786b0534f14da626a92e6890af1fed33d5bb77c413990142d5", "ja": "いたいた。奈緒、次のライブのことで\n話があるんだけど、いいか？", "zh": "找到你了。奈绪，关于下次的演唱会，\n我有事情要跟你说，有空吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_011_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "ca3fe333266d76424401c36565c805d8e961e479e0dceecba12bd076cad014f7", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nこのタイミングで私に声をかけるってことは……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n你在这时来找我说这个，代表……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_011_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "ac583abd4a9a95516e75cbe596f37af19c29d2f62e14ce089785fbae09792946", "ja": "私をセンターにするって話やんな？\nそうやんな？", "zh": "你打算让我当Center吼？\n对不对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_011_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ad328d86b9d479ea45ccd7583aaa4a0d5e7c0ff13ae2d448602e98db50cfc53c", "ja": "おお、すごいな。\nそうだよ、次の公演は奈緒がセンターだ。", "zh": "哦喔，你真厉害。\n没错，奈绪就是下次公演的Center。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_011_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "90d80a4c8a0f607524336d55146defe3e6a1aab661fbd5b6398fabba0e0cdfe8", "ja": "あははっ、やっぱりな～。\n世の中、そんな甘いもんと……。", "zh": "哈哈，我想也是啦～\n怎么可能有那么好的事咧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_011_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "314dcda3ad8db341995a8b52242772c96a7dbdf0012859d60772c6a9abccbb1f", "ja": "って、ええええええっ！？\n{$P$}さん、今なんて！？", "zh": "咦、咦咦咦咦咦咦！？\n{$P$}先生，你刚刚说什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_011_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8711fdcc091b8e99135fa0014c71b36d305ae9a836d8b169445d7aa5e4858752", "ja": "だから、次のセンターは、\n奈緒に任せるって言ったんだよ。", "zh": "我说，下次的Center就交给奈绪来负责啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_011_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "6b6c672c7368bdc90567186dbef2ee2d8efcd5bf4968266813143c2da69d747f", "ja": "ほんまに？\nほんまに私がセンターなんですかっ！？", "zh": "真的假的？\n真的是由我来当Center吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_011_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a9970ad396f5caea815226620081d505de1c71ebd8ee9238c4b2fa72608eca8d", "ja": "もちろん。奈緒がセンターだ！", "zh": "真的，奈绪是Center！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_011_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "b3c1f5041cc892289dada12a2861e0eb151510685235f8c05c8994a73ec887b4", "ja": "奈緒、やったじゃん！\nいよいよセンターからの景色、見られるよ！", "zh": "奈绪，太好了！\n你终于能看见Center才看得到的景色了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_011_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "9a22f98e792db604d6c54ea67c64b57b20a925ec6cb87cb7f144b1fbbba0f8ee", "ja": "やったね、奈緒ちゃん！　おめでとう～！\n今日はうちのお店でお祝いだね♪", "zh": "很棒耶，小绪！恭喜你～！\n今天就来我们店里庆祝吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_011_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "70e8d1c561cac6da2ca4645f33649ca294828b2c40a417b553d8669bd351d374", "ja": "のり子、美奈子……ありがとうな！　あはは、\nなんやビックリしすぎて、実感わかへんけど……。", "zh": "法子、美奈子……谢谢你们啰！\n哈哈，总觉得吓了好大一跳，感觉不太真实呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_011_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "3d7bb60acc24113920658b5e9e10a91d1b0490db9bbb0b00c5bd51b26c60f5e1", "ja": "そっか～。{$P$}さんも、\nやっと私の魅力に気づいてくれたんやな♪", "zh": "这样啊～{$P$}先生\n也终于注意到我的魅力了吼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_011_1013_p", "source_sha256": "28fee8365a6549b8d4364cfcf8ea7a455534950552db606750199386978abf99", "ja": "はは、そういうことだ。\n期待してるぞ、奈緒！", "zh": "哈哈，就是这么回事。\n我很期待你的表现喔，奈绪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_011_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "245109a34492bf1a44e7568ddcd84580c860c6dea0b105d00fb4b20f1da3cf53", "ja": "任せてください！　初センター、バッチリこなして、\n会場をメッチャ盛り上げてみせるで～！！", "zh": "放心交给我吧！第一次Center公演我会好好表现，\n让会场嗨到不行喔～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
